<title>USA: SBS Technologies sells division to FATS.</title>
<headline>SBS Technologies sells division to FATS.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBS Technologies Inc said Friday it has completed the previously announced sale of its ICAT Judgmental Use of Force business to Firearms Training Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
